  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [postcss-scss](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss) from `v0.4.1` to `v1.0.2`\n\n\n### Commits\n\n<details>\n<summary>postcss/postcss-scss</summary>\n\n#### 1.0.2\n-   [`9cebde7`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/9cebde74ac5687e236b4f2489c14cae163a7d298) Release 1.0.2 version\n-   [`98f98fe`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/98f98feadb10e6740ca52bcb69312dca9c39655b) Use PostCSS 6.0.3\n-   [`c1ef3e8`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/c1ef3e867cac7055c23f183315cc6359f4e76449) Update dependencies\n-   [`d0818b8`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/d0818b893965cdc0a6f194802e451e7cbb3d2cc1) Backport escape sequence parsing\n-   [`200f7c4`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/200f7c43470eef15873024ac0df3792033a802c4) Fix indent\n#### 1.0.1\n-   [`5e948e8`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/5e948e81fe32614f4c7d3af93904f473e7e92ae0) Release 1.0.1 version\n-   [`0c93ea4`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/0c93ea4cf044178b3a7ce7bc1facf899b0a802d2) Update dependencies\n-   [`81f8130`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/81f8130888aeccae5682f3f3e8844024df39a0e5) Support newline in url()\n-   [`9023a83`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/9023a83cdfc4701363873ebe17bc45ecab928d08) Add ChangeLog header\n#### 1.0.0\n-   [`f21242b`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/f21242b86baa9ad217ab64462a3f83151db14555) Release 1.0 version\n-   [`eb82675`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/eb82675109ebda6e83ac64dbd85474e45ac0576c) Use PostCSS 6\n-   [`48f6fbd`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/48f6fbdb393cd0440ad79a7815756531f266c14a) Update dependencies\n-   [`97dba6e`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/97dba6e108c4be7fb117baa3cf183fe0473b14e2) Use babel-preset-env\n-   [`f87894c`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/f87894c3d0a59366fb213b91c092e67130cd73c3) Move test to Jest\n-   [`c2f5237`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/c2f5237c156d804325ca56b61b28decc3a2cb5be) Remove node.js &lt; 4 support\n-   [`bbb2990`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/bbb2990d6111a670a2008e57444a758ee95fa904) Move configs to package.json\n-   [`8006851`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/80068512515726d0b978b536b5c128d5bbe57864) Better yarn usage\n-   [`09f4739`](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-scss/commit/09f4739b845782defc35ac6d9ca804afe40d60da) Fix .npmignore\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
